IMPORTANT_NOTICE = ['This result is based on visual examination and, where applicable, laboratory inspection, using the data and reference standards reasonably available as of the date of inspection.', 'The inspection and its results do not guarantee the identification or detection of all modifications, repairs, replaced parts, restorations, or other alterations to the item.', 'This certificate reflects TRUST LAB THAILAND’s independent professional assessment based solely on the condition of the item presented for inspection, the inspection methods applied, and the reference information reasonably available at the time of inspection.', 'This certificate does not constitute a legal determination that the item is counterfeit, infringes any trademark or other intellectual property right, or is associated with any unlawful activity. Unless expressly stated otherwise, the assessment is independent and does not constitute authentication, authorization, approval, or endorsement by the relevant brand or trademark owner.', 'This certificate is issued solely in connection with TRUST LAB THAILAND’s authentication services. It is not prepared or issued as an expert witness report, forensic report, or legal opinion, nor is it specifically prepared for litigation, court proceedings, criminal investigations, or other legal proceedings.', 'The issuance of this certificate does not constitute an agreement or undertaking by TRUST LAB THAILAND, its directors, employees, examiners, or consultants to appear as a witness, provide expert testimony, prepare an expert report, or otherwise participate in any dispute, investigation, or legal proceeding. Any such service, if accepted, shall be subject to a separate written agreement with TRUST LAB THAILAND.']
